{
  "bodyHash": "tw/nJunLt1E=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC7sSiQ.png\" width=\"408\" height=\"108\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>Delightful</strong> 是 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 的擴充模組，主打沉浸式與優先相容的內容。每個新功能皆可自由設定。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" alt=\"S'more\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>食物：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;棉花糖串</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;烤棉花糖串</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;烤棉花糖夾心</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 的巧克力）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinigang.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>酸湯</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;起司漢堡</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deluxe_cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;豪華起司漢堡</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;果醬罐</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/glow_jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;螢光果醬罐</strong>（附發光效果）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_bottle.png\" alt=\"堅果醬瓶\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;堅果醬瓶</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_and_jelly_sandwich.png\" alt=\"堅果醬果醬三明治\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;堅果醬果醬三明治</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ender_nectar.png\" alt=\"終界花蜜\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;終界花蜜</strong>（單次使用終界箱存取功能）<strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_flesh.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>仙人掌肉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_steak.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;仙人掌排</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;田園沙拉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/acorn.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;橡實</strong>（掉落自橡木樹葉的堅果）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rock_candy.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;冰糖</strong>（用於「forge:gems/rose_quartz」，建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/raw_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>生山羊肉</strong>（掉落自山羊）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>熟山羊肉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;生鹿肉排</strong>（用於「forge:raw_venison」，建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>熟鹿肉排</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cantaloupe_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;哈密瓜切片</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/InventivetalentDev/minecraft-assets/1.19.2/assets/minecraft/textures/item/pumpkin_pie.png\">&nbsp;南瓜派翻新</strong>（可設定）：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/pumpkin_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;現在你可以像 Farmer's Delight 的派一樣，將原版南瓜派放置在世界上！</p>\n<p>切開派可獲得&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/pumpkin_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;南瓜派切片</strong>，或直接右鍵食用。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>刀具</strong><strong>：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><em>必須在「config/delightful-common.toml」的設定中啟用刀具功能。</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 銅刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bone_knife.png\" alt=\"骨刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;骨刀</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bone Equipment</a> 使用）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\" alt=\"紫水晶刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;紫水晶刀</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amethyst Equipment</a> 使用）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/emerald_knife.png\" alt=\"綠寶石刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;綠寶石刀</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Emerald Equipment</a> 使用）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>相容刀具</strong>（標籤）<strong>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/tin_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong> 錫刀</strong>（forge:ingots/tin）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋼刀</strong>（forge:ingots/steel）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bronze_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;青銅刀</strong>（forge:ingots/bronze）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/silver_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;銀刀</strong>（forge:ingots/silver）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/brass_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黃銅刀</strong>（forge:ingots/brass）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;終界石刀</strong>（forge:ingots/enderite）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/black_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑歐泊刀</strong>（forge:gems/black_opal）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/constantan_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;康斯坦坦刀</strong>（forge:ingots/constantan）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/electrum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;琥珀金刀</strong>（forge:ingots/electrum）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/invar_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;因瓦合金刀</strong>（forge:ingots/invar）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lead_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鉛刀</strong>（forge:ingots/lead）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nickel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鎳刀</strong>（forge:ingots/nickel）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zinc_knife.png\" alt=\"鋅刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋅刀</strong>（forge:ingots/zinc）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a> 及其附加模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyroot_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>天根木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/holystone_knife.png\">&nbsp;聖石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zanite_knife.png\">&nbsp;藍晶石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gravitite_knife.png\">&nbsp;引力石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyjade_knife.png\">&nbsp;天玉刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stratus_knife.png\">&nbsp;層雲刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>翠晶石刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境：重製</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/infused_veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>灌注翠晶石刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境：重製</a></strong>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/fiery_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;熾熱刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ironwood_knife.png\">&nbsp;鐵木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/knightmetal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;騎士金屬刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steeleaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋼葉刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cloggrum_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"敲擊木刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;敲擊木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/forgotten_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"遺忘之刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;遺忘之刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/froststeel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"霜鋼刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;霜鋼刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/utherium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"烏瑟石刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;烏瑟石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism 工具</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/osmium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋨刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lapis_lazuli_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;青金石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_glowstone_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精製螢石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_obsidian_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精製黑曜石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物魔法</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">神話植物學</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/elementium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"元素刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;元素刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/manasteel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"魔力鋼刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;魔力鋼刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/terra_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"大地刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;大地刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/alf_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"精靈刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精靈刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">神話植物學</a></strong>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁忌與奧術</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 神聖刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/reinforced_deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;強化神聖刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/draco_arcanus_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;龍之奧術刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 擴充與附加</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_quartz_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a><strong> 鍍金石英刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/experience_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;經驗刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blazing_knife.png\" alt=\"烈焰刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a>烈焰刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleOres</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;亞德曼金屬刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/mythril_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;祕銀刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/onyx_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;縞瑪瑙刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/thyrium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;釷刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinisite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;罪惡石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rose_gold_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"玫瑰金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;玫瑰金刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_netherite_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"鍍金獄髓刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鍍金獄髓刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界幻想</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crystalline_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;水晶刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stellium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;星塵刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ores-above-diamonds\" rel=\"nofollow\">超越鑽石的礦石</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\">&nbsp;紫水晶刀</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/netherite_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;獄髓歐泊刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>單一刀具：</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精金刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightend</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/living_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;生命刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roots-classic\" rel=\"nofollow\">經典根植</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/warden_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;守衛者刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">）</a></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/obsidian_infused_enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑曜石灌注終界石刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">LieOnLion 的終界石</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tgwrFK3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 靈魂鋼刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spirit</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/necronium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"死靈刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 死靈刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phantasmic</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/allthemodium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;終極合金刀</strong>（用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/leaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 樹葉刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seeds</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/kiwano_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 奇異瓜刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>鮭魚莓</strong><strong>：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鮭魚莓</strong>是一種在森林中生成的美味新型莓果。它們適合隨身攜帶當作點心，或用於需要莓果的食譜，例如<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;莓果抹茶拿鐵</strong>。</p>\n<p>它們是以下物品的特殊食材：<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 鮭魚莓派</strong>（可以<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;切片）和<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 鮭魚莓冰淇淋</strong>（建議搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>)</p>\n<p>這些莓果可以合成為<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pips.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>鮭魚莓種子</strong>並種植（靈感來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berry Good</a>）。</p>\n<p>然而，<strong>鮭魚莓叢</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">需要雨水和光線</span>才能快速生長。</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/salmonberry_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鮭魚莓袋</strong>是用於儲存和裝飾莓果的方塊（靈感來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a>）。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>抹茶</strong><strong>：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_tea_leaf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;綠茶葉</strong>可以透過用刀對樹葉方塊使用獲得（隨機掉落）。來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫喘息</a>的綠茶葉相容並建議使用。</p>\n<p>它們可以在鍋中烹煮成<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶</strong>，一種濃縮的茶粉。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>接著可以用來製作兩種帶有效果的拿鐵：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶拿鐵</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;莓果抹茶拿鐵</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶冰淇淋</strong>（建議搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;油脂與食用油：</span><br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>動物油脂</strong>會隨機從任何「油膩」動物（標記為「delightful:fatty_animals」）掉落，包含一些相容支援。</p>\n<p>油脂可以烹煮成<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_oil_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>動物食用油瓶</strong>，它們是一種具有特殊能力的熔爐燃料：簡單的潛行右鍵點擊即可立即為熔爐補充燃料。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span>&nbsp;方塊：<br></strong></span></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/acorn_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;橡實袋</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eVJANTM.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;迷你西瓜</strong>（生成於平原）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/cantaloupe_side_small.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;哈密瓜</strong>（生成於海灘）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/quartz_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;石英櫥櫃</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;玄武岩櫥櫃</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/246/22/637155296232619409.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<strong>用於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">哦，你會去過的生物群落</a>：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/blueberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/green_apple_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie.png\">&nbsp;派系大改</strong>（停用任何切片物品即可關閉）：</p>\n<p>（建議搭配<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">派系大改</a>材質包）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/blueberry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/green_apple_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/nightshade_berry_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/crimson_berry_pie_top.png\">&nbsp;你現在可以像放置<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">農夫樂事</span>派一樣，在世界上放置任何<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">哦，你會去過的生物群落</span>派！</p>\n<p>切開派以獲得<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blueberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_apple_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;派的一片</strong>，或直接右鍵點擊食用。派會提供與之前相同的藥水效果。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/565/915/637924211543296813.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>用於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">新星藝術</a>：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/baileyholl/Ars-Nouveau/1.19.x/src/main/resources/assets/ars_nouveau/textures/items/source_berry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;源能莓派大改</strong>（停用切片物品即可關閉）：</p>\n<p>（建議搭配<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">派系大改</a>材質包）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/source_berry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;你現在可以像放置<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">農夫樂事</span>派一樣，在世界上放置<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新星藝術</span>源能莓派！</p>\n<p>切開派以獲得<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/source_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;一片源能莓派</strong>，或直接右鍵點擊食用。派會提供與之前相同的藥水效果。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>用於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">豐富生物群落</a></strong><strong>：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/chopped_clover.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;切碎的三葉草</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lavender_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;薰衣草茶</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/483/128/637782721029825410.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>用於</strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">生態學</a></strong><strong>：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/coconut_curry.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>椰子咖哩</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/honey_glazed_walnut.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;蜂蜜糖衣核桃</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/prickly_pear_juice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;仙人掌果果汁</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/azalea_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;杜鵑花茶</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
